add_claim("THE NEAR-POST POST-TO-POST ROUTINE, for the corner hit too deep to head directly: 'If you end up hitting a corner too deep that a header is probably going to get saved, just **C pass it lightly to the other side of the post to another player who can head it in with an A shot. This makes the keeper have to run post-to-post twice and you can easily score near-post.**'", 3, "setpieces/near-post-post-to-post-routine", [e_cd])
add_claim("THE HEIGHT REQUIREMENT for the squad: '**Have at least 3-4 players that are taller than 185** so you can win corners. **Almost always have a tall Striker so he can be the Target man when you win possession.**' A squad-construction rule - and it makes the Accommodation ladder pay in aerial duels as well as depth.", 3, "squad/three-to-four-players-above-185", [e_cd])
